{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disposable Corps</strong>\u00a0<strong>Most Authentic Trench Warfare</strong>\u00a0is a fun, lowpoly style, team based,  PvP, first person/third person Shooter game that is based on WW1 trench warfare background.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is also a turn based tower defense game which requires players from both sides to take turns to play defensive roles and offensive roles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Attack vs. Defense</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/01_-_Attack_vs._Defense.gif?t=1743746060\" /> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core battlefield experience: one side digs in, the other storms in. Watch the clash unfold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Destructible Environment</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/02_-_Destructible_Environment.gif?t=1743746060\" /> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No cover is truly safe! From artillery barrages to relentless digging, the battlefield constantly changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fortifications &amp; Trench Building</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/03_-_Fortifications___Trench_Building.gif?t=1743746060\" /> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the battle begins, the defense prepares\u2014digging trenches, setting up barricades, and turning the terrain into a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Vehicles &amp; Tactical Charges</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/04_-_Vehicles___Tactical_Charges.gif?t=1743746060\" /> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow, unstoppable advances\u2014armored vehicles and old tanks lead the way, with infantry charging right behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Close Combat</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/05_-_Intense_Close_Combat.gif?t=1743746060\" /> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trench warfare at its most intense: close-range firefights, melee brawls, and last-stand defenses where every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579070?t=1743746060","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/07d6f0d0fff52a3e2172ec51eb2992681a746f6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743746060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/da37919987df859fb4ca102a6557368efa7a9f0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743746060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/da37919987df859fb4ca102a6557368efa7a9f0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743746060","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game depicts realistic trench warfare with intense and graphic violence, including blood, gore, and dismemberment. Players will experience large-scale battles, close-quarters combat, and artillery bombardments, all presented with a high level of realism. While there is no sexual content, t